        "Product Advantages",
        "1. Suitable for separation of both coarse‑grained and fine‑grained fractions, realizing full‑size‑range flotation.\n2. Adopts a new‑style impeller‑stator system. The cell body is equipped with forced‑circulation channels with false bottom and grid plates.\n3. Production specification range: 2 m³‑40 m³.\n4. Effective volume range: 2 m³‑40 m³. ",
